{"title":"Ivan the Terrible, Part I","original_title":"Иван Грозный","directors":["Sergei Eisenstein"],"cast_top":["Nikolai Cherkasov","Lyudmila Tselikovskaya","Serafima Birman","Mikhail Nazvanov","Mikhail Zharov","Amvrosii Buchma","Mikhail Kuznetsov","Pavel Kadochnikov"],"genres":["drama","history"],"keywords":["coronation","exile","treason","tatars","wedding","church","intrigue","medieval"],"overview":"Set during the early part of his reign, Ivan faces betrayal from the aristocracy and even his closest friends as he seeks to unite the Russian people.  Sergei Eisenstein's final film, this is the first part of a three-part biopic of Tsar Ivan IV of  Russia, which was never completed due to the producer's dissatisfaction with Eisenstein's attempts to use forbidden experimental filming techniques and excessive cost overruns.","release_year":1944,"runtime_minutes":95,"original_language":"ru","poster_path":"/rzFWfdq6CXLCnlfXTTZs9W9dMR2.jpg","backdrop_path":"/ohn9zA2dUbVuo4ajx32Em97qvMr.jpg","tmdb_id":9797},
