{"title":"Gate of Flesh","original_title":"肉体の門","directors":["Seijun Suzuki"],"cast_top":["Joe Shishido","Kōji Wada","Yumiko Nogawa","Tomiko Ishii","Kayo Matsuo","Satoko Kasai","Misako Tominaga","Isao Tamagawa"],"genres":["drama","crime"],"keywords":["tokyo","japan","prostitution","post war japan","japanese new wave","shōwa era (1926-89)","post-war chaos period"],"overview":"In the shady black markets and bombed-out hovels of post–World War II Tokyo, a tough band of prostitutes eke out a dog-eat-dog existence, maintaining tenuous friendships and a semblance of order in a world of chaos. But when a renegade ex-soldier stumbles into their midst, lusts and loyalties clash, with tragic results.","release_year":1964,"runtime_minutes":90,"original_language":"ja","poster_path":"/yRi34m5PlktF5NdgHEKOzyOkHGo.jpg","backdrop_path":"/lpY4RTJpuKboamSwE1IYK36RB7A.jpg","tmdb_id":86666},
