{"title":"Metropolitan","original_title":"Metropolitan","directors":["Whit Stillman"],"cast_top":["Edward Clements","Chris Eigeman","Taylor Nichols","Carolyn Farina","Isabel Gillies","Dylan Hundley","Allison Parisi","Bryan Leder"],"genres":["comedy","drama","romance"],"keywords":["new york city","upper class","philosophy","manhattan","debutante","socialite party","young adult"],"overview":"A radical student is adopted by a group of young New Yorkers, serves as a catalyst to alter his and their lives. Gathering in a Manhattan apartment, the group of friends meet to discuss social mobility, Fourier's socialism and play bridge in their cocoon of upper-class society - until they are joined by a man with a critical view of their way of life.","release_year":1990,"runtime_minutes":99,"original_language":"en","poster_path":"/852ZwTRj9tRxkGOT0Pu0Ep8yimk.jpg","backdrop_path":"/hyHp1MgvUXw40GLjhqfjxwMWD4.jpg","tmdb_id":15389},
