{"title":"The Inland Sea","original_title":"The Inland Sea","directors":["Lucille Carra"],"cast_top":["Donald Richie"],"genres":["documentary"],"keywords":["japan","woman director","travelogue"],"overview":"In 1971, author and film scholar Donald Richie published a poetic travelogue about his explorations of the islands of Japan’s Inland Sea, recording his search for traces of a traditional way of life as well as his own journey of self-discovery. Twenty years later, filmmaker Lucille Carra undertook a parallel trip inspired by Richie’s by-then-classic book, capturing images of hushed beauty and meeting people who still carried on the fading customs that Richie had observed.","release_year":1991,"runtime_minutes":56,"original_language":"en","poster_path":"/w9TeWIRxHJ1xI4skSc6XPNhCLVZ.jpg","backdrop_path":"/uR6Jjibj8xpMOx4NMFNlXDb1PcY.jpg","tmdb_id":367453},
